  "sudop_bgk_kit_v3": {"id":"sudop_bgk_kit_v3","recurrence":"recurs","funderVerdict":"between_calls","url":"https://www.funduszeunijne.gov.pl/nabory/232-kredyt-technologiczny/","checkedAt":"2026-08-13","quote":"23.03.2023 r. - 31.05.2023 r. godz.: 16:00","funderSays":"The register measure names a real product a company applies to: BGK's technology credit with a non-repayable 'technological bonus'. It continues into 2021-2027 as FENG dzialanie 2.32 Kredyt technologiczny, run by Bank Gospodarstwa Krajowego. The Ministry's own nabor page marks the only FENG call Zakonczony: it ran 23.03.2023-31.05.2023, 88 projects were recommended and the allocation of 763 634 061,08 zl was fully used. No further 2.32 call appears in the FENG 2026 call-schedule update we read.","source":"wsgl_manufactured_rows_2026-08-13.jsonl"},
  "sudop_ncbr_aid": {"id":"sudop_ncbr_aid","recurrence":"recurs","funderVerdict":"between_calls","url":"https://gov.pl/web/ncbr/sciezka-smart---projekty-realizowane-w-konsorcjach","checkedAt":"2026-08-13","quote":"12.06.2026, godz. 16.00","funderSays":"The register name is an umbrella aid basis - 'the granting of State aid through NCBR' - and is not itself something a company applies to. The call a founder applies to under it is Sciezka SMART, FENG dzialanie 1.1: NCBR runs the consortium and non-SME tracks, PARP runs the MSP track. NCBR's own page shows call FENG.01.01-IP.01-002/26 having run 09.04.2026 to 12.06.2026 16:00 and now in evaluation; the FENG programme site's 2026 schedule announces the next Sciezka SMART calls for December 2026.","source":"wsgl_manufactured_rows_2026-08-13.jsonl"},
